# Notice

## pstack

The method in `skills/rigor/SKILL.md` and the skills `architect`, `interrogate`,
`swarm`, `blast-radius`, `decision-log`, `investigate`, and `unslop` are adapted
from pstack by poteto (Lauren Tan).

    pstack
    Copyright (c) 2026 Lauren Tan
    MIT License
    https://github.com/cursor/plugins/tree/main/pstack

pstack is a Cursor plugin of 50 skills and 23 playbooks. This pack condenses that
method into nine skills rewritten for Claude Code: Cursor-specific references and
hardcoded model slugs are removed, and everything is made subordinate to section 7
of `AGENTS.md`, which keeps the human as the merge authority.

The wording here is rewritten, not copied. The ideas, the principle names, the
routing table, and the evidence ladder are Lauren Tan's.

